sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Operator
  participant CLI as Platform CLI
  participant Source as Authored source
  participant API as Kubernetes API
  participant Gateway as agentgateway
  participant Edge as Production edge

  rect rgb(232, 240, 250)
    Note over Operator, Edge: Stage 1 — Discover (read-only, no cluster mutation)
    Operator->>CLI: discover
    CLI->>API: read model Services, routes, edge state
    API-->>CLI: observed environment
    CLI-->>Operator: candidates and required overrides
  end

  rect rgb(232, 240, 250)
    Note over Operator, Edge: Stage 2 — Plan (offline, reviewable, deterministic)
    Operator->>CLI: deploy plan --overlay
    CLI->>Source: read configuration and Kustomize overlay
    Source-->>CLI: rendered manifests
    CLI-->>Operator: plan.json and plan.md
  end

  rect rgb(252, 244, 227)
    Note over Operator, Edge: Stage 3 — Apply (gated by context, token, approved plan)
    Operator->>CLI: deploy apply --expected-context --confirm --plan-file
    CLI->>API: capture pre-change snapshot
    CLI->>API: apply only the actions listed in the plan
    API->>Gateway: reconcile Gateway, routes, and policies
  end

  rect rgb(252, 244, 227)
    Note over Operator, Edge: Stage 4 — Verify (internal path, production traffic untouched)
    CLI->>Gateway: poll Programmed, Accepted, ResolvedRefs, Attached
    Gateway-->>CLI: resource conditions
    CLI->>Gateway: request matrix — 401, 403, 200, 429, 404
    Gateway-->>CLI: observed responses
    CLI-->>Operator: verification report
  end

  rect rgb(252, 244, 227)
    Note over Operator, Edge: Stage 5 — Cut over (smallest production change)
    Operator->>CLI: cutover plan
    CLI-->>Operator: edge change and rollback anchor
    Operator->>CLI: cutover apply
    CLI->>Edge: repoint edge backend to the gateway Service
  end

  rect rgb(250, 235, 235)
    Note over Operator, Edge: Stage 6 — Roll back (only when verification fails)
    Operator->>CLI: rollback apply --ledger-file
    CLI->>Edge: restore the previous edge backend first
    CLI->>API: restore pre-existing state, delete only run-created resources
    CLI-->>Operator: rollback report
  end
